</span></b></h1><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >「业务背景」在东南亚电商市场度过人口流量红利阶段之后</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >在产品或者商业决策的成本逐渐凸显，为了让决策更加科学合理、试错成本尽可能更小，达到循环复利持续增长的目的，</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >LAB平台诞生了。 LAB 平台是互联网公司A/B 测试实验平台，支撑互联网公司买家、卖家、供应链等各种业务形态，覆盖某公司 所有核心业务域 ；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >「</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >LAB数据建设背景」A/B Test平台 是具备平台和数据双重属性，在帮助业务完成实验全生命周期管理、实验流量管理之外，还需具备完整的数据采集、到数据处理、数据计算、数据分析及数据展示的完整数据链路能力；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >「业务需求」</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >LAB平台除提供全生命周期以外，从平台能力上可以提供更多实验数据科学能力、实验智能化决策能力；在业务支撑上，不仅支撑业务差异化分析场景需求以外，能够借助Lab搭建体系化的数据基础并且沉淀面向业务的增长分析框架。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><br></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.LAB 1.0 数据架构</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.1 数据特点 </font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 多国家 ：需支撑东南亚六个国家实验，同样的数据在不同国家的计算逻辑不完全相同；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 多种实验类型 ：AB实验根据分流场景的不同、业务场景的不同会有 服务端实验、客户端实验、URL实验、H5实验、离线分桶实验等多种实验类型；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 多种分流类型 ：根据AB实验在端侧SDK分流引擎上报的设备及用户标识的不同 、在分析阶段统计口径上的不同会有有按 user_id , utdid , cna 等多种分流及统计类型；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 多种指标类型 ：在数据指标上需支持 集团A+产品通用数据指标 (平台级&SPM粒度级等），另外业务相对较为复杂的个性化指标数据；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.2 设计准则 </font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >基于</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >LAB前期业务、数据建设背景和业务需求，结合LAB业务数据特点，LAB 1.0 数据架构设计的主要准则为如下 ：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 规范 </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >数据采集</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >多端、多业务形态数据采用标准规范的数据采集及数据处理</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >数仓分层</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >基于集团</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >OneData数据规范，设计标准规范的数据模型，搭建清晰标准的数仓分层架构</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 通用 </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >通用数据</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >首先需要一次性解决全域通用分析场景；如业务做实验关注不同分桶用户群在某公司平台级别、具体页面级别、模块级别上的用户流量、引导商品、引导交易、支付等行为及转化路径上的具体表现；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >数据链路</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：通用分析场景数据及业务个性化数据场景使用统一的数据计算及展示的数据链路</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 成本 </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >构建统一中间层，可复用性高，汇总层覆盖全类型实验，避免重复开发；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >应用层海量实验数据使用成本更低的</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Lindorm进行存储，包含每天线上全量分桶全域实验数据；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.LAB 1.0 数仓架构</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"628"  height=3D"385"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}676943944.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.1 LAB 数据源</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >来自于某公司业务系统产生数据，主要来源有：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 服务端分流数据 ： 服务端实验、算法实验等类型实验在端侧通过 lab 服务端sdk采集上报的实验相关日志数据；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 客户段分流数据 ： 在安卓、IOS等客户端侧通过lab客户端sdk采集上报实验相关日志及用户行为数据</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- H5 分流数据 ：在端内或者端外通过黄金令箭和aplus sdk来上报实验相关日志及用户行为数据；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 业务数据 ：各业务在端侧的日志数据及实验命中用户在业务服务器日志数据</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.2 LAB 1.0 整体数仓分层</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- ODS层</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >在</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >ODS层中对上述各类数据源(离线数据及消息数据)进行原始数据的接入及存储，并进行数据进行解析、清洗、脱敏等处理；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- DWD层</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >主要针对</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >ODS层的数据进行进一步解析、分类、加工、增强处理，准实时类型的数据将分钟、小时级别的数据进一步转化处理为T+1的离线数据，涉及到的业务数据根据业务过程构建业务明细数据；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- DWS层</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >基于某公司流量公共层数据</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >结合</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >lab各类实验数据构建各实验类型面向通用域的DWS层事实表(pv、clk、ipv、atc、lead_order、lead_pay等)，底层数据及口径跟集团通A+通用数据产品中的口径一致，不同实验类型数据链路上会有一定的差异；另外是面向业务领域或者业务过程的dws层数据，如前期针对social、share、sellerpdp 等业务设计的业务明细汇总数据；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >DIM</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >层</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >根据不同的实验类型及数据分析场景分别产生单独的实验数据维表</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- ADS层</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >ADS层直接面向某公司全域多维的实验数据，是直接面向lab业务应用层的结果汇总数据 </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.3 数据存储</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >选择</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Lindorm做为应用层数据存储，主要考虑Lindrom可支持千万级高并发吞吐、毫秒级访问延迟，共享存储，使用低成本存储介质，支持智能冷热分离和自适应压缩；融合多模存储架构中的宽表引擎 针对面向LAB实验粒度的数据，支持多列簇、动态列、TTL、多版本等特性 ，可以很好的适应业务需求频繁变更而带来的表结构不稳定 从而经常需要变更的业务场景。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >在</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >LAB通用数据场景中的多维度、少量组合列且有固定查询模式的场景来说，Lindorm内置的高性能全局二级索引功能也可以满足业务需求，同时仍保持强大的吞吐与性能；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Lindrom 目前已经很好解决全域通用实验数据的场景 ，每天支撑某公司线上运行中的1000+个各业务实验，4000+的用户实验分组，每天产生3亿+全域通用数据，以极低存储成本保障线上百亿数据毫秒级响应的用户体验。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.4 数据计算链路</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"558"  height=3D"601"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}676945297.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >4.LAB 数据1.0阶段的总结思考</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >在</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1.0阶段完协同工程侧完成实验域，流量域、数据域的搭建，在数据域完成了数据采集、数据处理、数据计算、数据存储 到最终数据展示的完整链路，并且顺利跑通了某公司 300+个实验，并产出了一系列成功典型的实验案例。然而在1.0 阶段发展往后支撑的业务越来越多样，某公司 各业务线实验需求越来越频繁，对实验效率及数据效率的期望越来越高，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >原先的数据架构遇到越来越多的挑战且出现一些瓶颈，主要体现在以下几个方面</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >整体开发周期较长出现</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >ETL资源瓶颈，缺乏灵活性无法快速适应复杂多变的业务诉求，整体缺乏可扩展性深度下钻能力，受封网影响较大大促期间无法正常支持业务实验。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"622"  height=3D"225"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}676945860.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >5.LAB 2.0 数据架构</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >5.1 需要解决的问题</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 数据效率 </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >随着数据驱动、实验驱动文化氛围在某公司越来浓厚，各业务实验数越来越多，整体实验数在集团各</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >BU中排名前列； 因此对实验数据效率上提出更高的要求来支撑某公司 全域业务的AB实验数据；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 灵活扩展 </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >面对更多业务形态，更多复杂业务场景，希望具备更加灵活快速的数据分析能力，同时具备更好的可扩展性，能够多维下钻分析数据帮助业务深度的实验数据洞察；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 数据标准化 </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >当前某公司各业务实验数据比较分散，不同业务间数据口径不一致，业务实验观测数据太多不知道如何决策等问题；需构建某公司</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >各业务实验核心数据体系来数据统一化、标准化，方便后续实验卡口；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >业务定制化</font> </span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >不同业务实验分析框架存在差异，针对具有复杂的业务分析场景且实验分析框架比较成熟的业务进行定制化数据方案设计，以满足核心业务在</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >LAB平台上一站式实验数据分析能力；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 决策智能化 ： </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >以往实验结果数据大多由</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >lab分析师同学帮忙分析判断实验效果的显著性，在下一阶段的目的是由平台自动且智能化的给用户科学的统计学推断能力、完整的决策建议；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face=3D"微软雅黑" >这需要对某公司线上全域全量通用数据及全域业务个性化数据提出新的要求：如何自动化实现全域数据基于统计学的实验数据效果显著性推断能力。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >6.LAB 2.0 数仓架构</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"541"  height=3D"423"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}676946686.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >6.1 LAB 2.0 数据架构</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 业务层&数据源：LAB平台已经接入某公司 六大核心业务域，服务买家、卖家、供应链等业务形态，支持APP端、PC端、Msite等全部场景的AB实验；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 数据计算：在数据时效性上由原先的离线计算T+1 的模式，引进实时计算设计按小时产出业务实验流量及业务端内用户流量行为数据；在数据模型上设计Lab业务实验主题模型，针对核心业务域构建标准规范的数据指标体系，保证实验数据的统一、规范、准确；对部分具备成熟的实验分析框架的核心业务域(如首页、PDP等)设计独立的实验数据解决方案，定制化生成实验数据看版；对Lab全域通用数据及业务个性化数据结合统计学方法重新设计lab数仓，使得全域数据具备统计学检验的基础能力，支持上层实验数据置信度分析；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 数据存储 ：在数据存储上采用多个olap引擎，adb用以业务个性化数据的自定义创建配置；lab通用数据及业务定制化实验数据继续使用lindorm做为存储引擎，支持业务数据固定维度的多维任意组合查询；针对业务实时数据采用Holo进行数据的存储及查询计算引擎，以及后续的Lab流批一体探索；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >- 数据服务 ：由原先的数据Lab dashboard ，平台逐渐对外提供基于olap的Lab指标托管系统赋予各业务实验同学在平台一站式自助完成自定义分析、多维分析、置信度分析、留存分析等功能。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >7.LAB 2.0 数据建设中的关键问题、方案及思考</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >7.1 问题一</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >「</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >LAB实验数据效率及分析灵活性可扩展性提升」互联网公司各业务在lab 平台实验数越来越多，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >原先由</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >LAB 团队帮助支持实验数据的方式不适合当前现状；在1.0阶段实验数据在ODPS以ADS层实验粒度进行产出并保存在Lindorm，这种方式分析维度单一，且整体开发链路长。如何进一步提高实验数据效率？ 如何简化实验数据分析链路？ 如何将实验数据分析更加灵活且可以让业务分析同学进行自助式分析 ？ 如何将实验分析具备更多分析下钻能力 ？</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >7.1.1 问题抽象</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"224"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}676947800.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >问题</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：门槛高，周期长，不灵活</font> </span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >思路</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：一站式自助分析，高效灵活多维查询分析平台</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >7.1.2 解决方案 1.</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >基于</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >OLAP的数据引擎</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Lab平台在数据架构上引入OLAP数据引擎，借助其高性能在线计算分析能力；首先将业务核心数据抽象设计可复用性高且符合规范的主题模型及维度模型；通过同步任务引擎，将数据从odps同步到olap 数据仓库；最终用户在Lab平台通过自助式的定义配置指标及分析维度；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"602"  height=3D"310"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}676948261.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >7.1.3 解决方案2.</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >指标托管体系的数据规范</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >指标托管体系最核心的内容是将分桶数据与业务数据进行染色，再根据指标定义进行分组聚合分析的过程，这种数据分析处理模式是数据模型中很典型的星型模型</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >；星型模型是由事实表及维度表组成，在指标托管系统中的维度表是</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >AB实验分桶维表和各类业务用户属性维度表，而事实表是对某一个业务域的某个业务过程进行分析粒度级度量后的汇总表；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"115"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}676948706.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(64,64,64);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >结合以往某公司</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >各业务个性化实验数据场景进行抽象提炼，简单总结为如下格式，</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >可自行创建下述格式的业务数据事实表</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(除了标记为必填的,其他都是选填字段) ，即可自助完成业务实验数据自定义分析；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><table class=3DMsoNormalTable  border=3D1  cellspacing=3D0  style=3D"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:4.8000pt;border:none;=20mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-insideh:0.7500pt outset windowtext;mso-border-insidev:0.7500pt outset windowtext;=20mso-padding-alt:0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt ;" ><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"fo