 style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dpre  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=3D"微软雅黑" >)t</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dpre  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >GROUP BY stat_date,bucket_id</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dpre  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >;</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >7.3 问题三</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >「</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >LAB 标准规范的全域实验数据体系建设」</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >随着</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >lab平台的更加成熟，平台上的实验越来越多，业务实验产生的指标数据也越来越多，带来的问题就是业务数据模型上 数据分散不够体系化、模型归属不清、可复用性低且无法深入洞察等... 业务关注的指标上：各个团队之间口径不一致、部分业务核心指标未覆盖全、缺乏实验指标定义说明、实验观测指标太多不确定决策时以哪个指标去做判断 ...</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >7.3.1 问题抽象</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >问题</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：以往的实验数据工作更多是在业务广度上，模式上更多是承接需求式，缺乏体系化的建设，无资产及能力沉淀；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >思路</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：能力输出及策略上的升级</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：体系化规划，数据资产及能力沉淀，主动赋能业务；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >7.3.2 解决方案 </font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(64,64,64);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1.</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >核心业务</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >实验数据体系建设</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"186"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}6769413098.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >针对已经有成熟体系化的分析框架的业务，按业务分析场景及分析框架定制化开发相关主题模型</font> </span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >针对已经接入实验但未接入数据</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >或</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >或已接入数据但无体系化的业务进行提前规划，提前建设面向增长的业务实验数据模型；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"202"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}6769413463.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"margin-bottom:12.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >7.3.3 解决方案2.</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >业务指标体系建设方法论</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >指标分级</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >一级指标：业务的核心</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >KPI指标（建议3个及以内）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >必须是全</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >BU都认可的、衡量业务KPI的核心指标， 它可以直接指引业务的战略目标，衡量业务目标达成情况，本质上需要管理层和下级员工的双向理解、认同，且要易于沟通传达 ； </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >二级指标：业务链路漏斗核心拆解指标</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >（建议</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >10个及以内）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >二级指标是</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >促进</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >KPI达成的关键影响因素或链路拆解指标</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >；当一级指标发生异常时，通过查看二级指标，能够快速定位问题的原因所在；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >三级指标：其他辅助指标，负向指标或不常用指标</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >（暂不限制个数）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >三级指标可以是对二级指标的过程性指标，可以是业务实验分析中关注的负向指标。通过三级指标，可以高效定位二级指标波动的原因，并可以快速做出相应的动作；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >纵观业务在</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Lab平台实验核心流程，是围绕某个业务目标，按照某个业务策略假设进行实验，通过核心度量指标进行效果观测及最终决策的过程 ； 将这个过程对外拓展，抛开实验从业务全局视觉来看 那就是</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >标准的</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >OSM方法论</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >O (</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Obejective</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >) 业务目标 : </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >贴合业务核心价值及目的</font> </span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >S (</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Strategy</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >) 业务策略 : </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >为达成上述目标采取的一系列策略</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >，可比较，可行动</font> </span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >M (</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Measurement</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >) 业务度量 ： 上述</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(68,68,68);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >策略带来的变化通过数据指标进行度量</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"339"  src=3D"~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}67694.files/~tmp{285c8f0c-bd22-4df6-90ef-be21d4dcc254}6769414294.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >8.实验指标的开发</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;display:none;=20mso-hide:all;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Expand source</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacer